## 2. Why This Matters

ClarityStack has crossed a key architectural boundary:

From:

> A chat app with structured summaries

To:

> A persistent causal reasoning system with evolving beliefs

Now the system can:

* Track why a decision was made
* Show what supported it
* Show what opposed it
* Show what remains unknown
* Show how it evolved over time

This is the foundation for:

* Decision auditability
* Knowledge reuse
* Long-term project memory
* Context-aware future reasoning

